Data in this repository that is not under the Apache License
------------------------------------------------------------

evals/real1 and evals/real_dev are derived from the Spider text-to-SQL dataset
(Yu et al., 2018, https://yale-lily.github.io/spider). The questions and tables are
Spider's; each expected result is what Spider's own SQL returns. Spider is licensed
under CC BY-SA 4.0, and these two folders are distributed under the same licence.

evals/real2 is derived from the dev split of the BIRD benchmark (Li et al., 2023,
https://bird-bench.github.io). The questions, their evidence lines and the tables are
BIRD's; each expected result is what BIRD's own SQL returns. BIRD is licensed under
CC BY-SA 4.0, and this folder is distributed under the same licence.

CC BY-SA 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

What the VIC models were trained on
-----------------------------------

The base models are Qwen3-1.7B and Qwen3.5-2B (Alibaba Cloud, Apache License 2.0).
The training data is machine-written and machine-verified requests with their plans,
written through hosted models (gpt-oss-120b, GLM-5.3, Qwen3.8-27B). From run k5
onward it also includes questions from Spider's train split, each paired with a plan
that was kept only when its result equals the result of Spider's SQL.
